    <item>
      <title>Director of PAE SSP Outlines Strategic Deterrence Roadmap at Naval Submarine League Symposium</title>
      <link>https://www.navy.mil/Press-Office/News-Stories/display-news/Article/4655576/director-of-pae-ssp-outlines-strategic-deterrence-roadmap-at-naval-submarine-le/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;ARLINGTON, Va. - Vice Adm. Douglas Williams, director of Portfolio Acquisition Executive (PAE) Strategic Systems Programs (SSP), provided his roadmap of how PAE SSP is partnering with industry to power the nation&amp;rsquo;s sea based strategic deterrence mission at the Naval Submarine League&amp;rsquo;s (NSL) Annual Symposium &amp;amp; Industry Update in Arlington, Virginia, on Nov. 13.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;img src='https://media.defense.gov/2026/Nov/19/2004034395/150/150/0/261113-N-CH133-1013.JPG' alt='ARLINGTON, Va. - Vice Adm. Douglas Williams, director of Portfolio Acquisition Executive (PAE) Strategic Systems Programs (SSP), spoke at the Naval Submarine League’s Annual Symposium &amp;amp; Industry Update on Nov. 13, 2026. This was Williams’ first time addressing the Naval Submarine League since assuming command of PAE SSP in June.' /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;
</description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:28:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Thomas Jones</dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.navy.mil/Press-Office/News-Stories/display-news/Article/4655576/director-of-pae-ssp-outlines-strategic-deterrence-roadmap-at-naval-submarine-le/</guid>
