      <title>USS Mount Whitney Visits Piraeus, Reinforcing U.S.-Greece Maritime Partnership </title>
      <link>https://www.navy.mil/Press-Office/News-Stories/display-news/Article/4648992/uss-mount-whitney-visits-piraeus-reinforcing-us-greece-maritime-partnership/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Blue Ridge-class command and control ship USS Mount Whitney (LCC 20), flagship of U.S. 6th Fleet, completed a scheduled port visit in Piraeus, Greece, Nov. 15, 2026, highlighting the longstanding maritime partnership between the United States and Greece.&lt;/p&gt;
