&lt;img src='https://media.defense.gov/2026/Nov/13/2004027432/150/150/0/261112-N-BD352-2066.JPG' alt='The Blue Ridge-class command and control ship USS Mount Whitney (LCC 20) invites guests aboard for a Key Leader Engagment in Piraeus, Greece, November 12, 2026. Mount Whitney is on a scheduled deployment in the U.S. 6th Fleet area of operations to support the warfighting effectiveness, lethality and readiness of U.S. Naval Forces Europe-Africa, and defend U.S., Allied and partner interests in the region. (U.S. Navy photo by Mass Communication Specialist 1st Class Isaac Esposito)' /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;
</description>
